  "scope": "Read-only GitHub source audit: uncertain/failed speech recognition must not become negative reading competence. No local calls, tests, UI or device execution, product writes or Git mutations.",
  "conclusion": "PARTIALLY_GUARDED_CONCRETE_SECONDARY_READING_SUMMARY_GAP",
  "strengths": [
    "Reading Buddy's ASR output does not record learning answers; only explicit comprehension choices call saveAnswer.",
    "Sentence-coach _logReadingAttempt rejects every not-correct or not-accepted decision. Negative ASR output does not increment SkillRecord.wrong through this gate.",
    "True cancellation increments generation, drops text and callbacks; route/lifecycle cleanup cancels; stale result/profile guards exist.",
    "Empty final text is not delivered; empty no-match uses a neutral message, no wrong answer. Missing local Android recognizer fails closed without cloud initialization.",
    "An accepted later rereading clears in-memory ledger problem words; the direct competence record's wrong count remains zero."
  ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "ASR-READING-SUMMARY",
      "classification": "concrete source dataflow gap; not newly reproduced",
      "chain": [
        "LumoSpeechListener supplies text only, and promotes an existing partial transcript to final when provider onError fires.",
        "ReadingContent calls ReadingMonitor without confidence or provider error provenance.",
        "ReadingAttemptLedger judges plausibility from transcript alignment; repeated plausible mismatches become persistentProblemWords and interventionCount.",
        "ReadingContent persists alignment/words to ReadingProgressRepository regardless of retryBecauseRecognitionWasUnclear.",
        "ReadingProgressRepository stores shared-preference summaries with score,problemWords,interventions, but no evidence-status or confirmation field.",
        "ParentReportCard loads the summaries and ParentReportEngine maps problemWords/interventions to weaknesses/errorPatterns; widget labels them Förderbedarf."
      ],
      "limit": "The direct SkillRecord negative-answer guard still works; do not describe this as all reading assessment being unsafe."
    },
    {
      "id": "ASR-CORRECTION-RETENTION",
      "classification": "concrete source union behavior; not newly reproduced",
      "detail": "A later correct transcript clears the in-memory ledger, but updateLatest unions existing.problemWords with current.problemWords. Passing an empty corrected list cannot remove an old persisted word."
    },
    {
      "id": "ASR-CONFIDENCE-LOSS",
      "classification": "concrete transport/guard omission",
      "detail": "Speech callbacks expose String only. Actual recognizer confidence/unknown status is not forwarded. Monitor/analyzers default confidence to1; analyzer event confidence is not a rejection gate. The label lowConfidence in V2 is text-similarity derived, not proof of a measured provider-confidence threshold."
    }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "true cancel/back/background/dispose",
      "direct_skill": "no automatic negative write",
      "secondary_summary": "previous session summary may remain; cancellation does not itself call transcript grading",
      "support": "source + profile-switch and pending-start regressions, no new device execution"
    },
    {
